Examples: Amelia Boynton Robinson, Fred Shuttlesworth, Martin Luther King, Jr., Ralph David Abernathy, Rosa Parks, Virginia Foster Durr
Examples: Condoleezza Rice, Hugo Black, Lurleen Wallace, Richard Shelby, U.W. Clemon, William B. Bankhead
Examples: catfish farming, forestry, peanut production, poultry production
Examples: agricultural research, infrastructure development, military spending
