Grade 2
H.1.2.1 Create historical narratives about a sequence of changes in a community or region over time using primary-source documents such as letters, stories, interviews with elders, photographs, maps, and artifacts. Events may include: ● Founding of the town ● Development of schools or businesses ● Election of local and county leaders
