AZ 2018 History and Social Science Standards _Update8.23.19.pdf: u290, u329: unit begins with the grade subtitle (e.g. 'prehistoric to present-day Arizona', 'Pre-contact Americas ...') merged with overview narrative; labeled examples.
AZ 2018 History and Social Science Standards _Update8.23.19.pdf: u351: orphaned 'Key concepts' bullet after page break (belongs to 4.E3.1), kept as standards.
AZ 2018 History and Social Science Standards _Update8.23.19.pdf: u317: 3.G4.1 lacks a bullet marker; u363 contains typo '4H2.2'; u408 '5G4.1' (extraction/source typos).
AZ 2018 History and Social Science Standards _Update8.23.19.pdf: State guide notes consistent: grades K,1-8 and 9-12; HS has no grade-specific courses.
