“Although many countries are addressing pollution, environmental degradation continues to create devastating human health problems each year.”
Meanings:
n Pollution is a big problem around the world.
n People are creating pollution and ruining the environment.
n The ruined environment leads to health problems in people.
n Health problems are still happening every year.
n The health problems are really, really bad.
