ColoradoAcademicStandards-SocialStudiesStandardsP-12adopted2022_1.pdf: Two-column interleaving: continuation units without a prefix were assigned by x-position and leading numbering (e.g. u88 x=414 = Supportive Teaching items 4-9 of preschool civics; u94-u97 preschool civics ordering scrambled; u1438-u1446 HS Standards 1.3 evidence outcomes c-g split across x=414/428/68). Wrapped Students Can text where a fragment has no x and no list marker inherits the previous unit's category (e.g. u132, u326, u343, u1352).
