Social Studies - Georgia Department of Education-CASE-items.csv: State guide says Ed. Level 'KG-12' skills charts apply to the grades marked; K-8 grade-section copies were assigned to their parent grade (see above). Grade 9-12 skills copies do not exist in this export.
