May include: • Mountains: o The Apennine Mountains ran down the length of Italy o The Alps Mountains are located in northern Italy • Seas: The Mediterranean Sea surrounds much of the peninsula • Hills: Seven Hills of Rome within the city area • Climate: Warm, dry summers and mild, wet winters
May include:
• Location:
o Located in central Italy, on the Italian Peninsula
