May include: • Maya: o Kings and nobles ruled. o Priests lead religious ceremonies. o Farmers and merchants made food and goods. o Enslaved people had the lowest status. • Aztec: o The Emperor was the top leader. o Nobles and priests had some power. o Warriors protected the empire. o Common people farmed and traded. o Enslaved people had some rights. • Inca: o The Emperor was seen as a god. o Nobles and priests helped run the empire. o Farmers and workers supported the empire. o No enslaved people like others, but people had to work for the government.
May include:
