IL-Social-Science-Standards_4db7c3.pdf: u181-u192: page 12 text blocks are interleaved from three columns (x=108, 540, 847); u183, u184, u192 split mid-sentence and combine elementary/6-8/9-12 narratives; labelled backup all. u185, u186, u188, u189, u191 (discipline and strand name lists) labelled standards K-12 as the organizing strand names.
IL-Social-Science-Standards_4db7c3.pdf: u238, u408, u414, u415 and similar: typos in standard codes in the source (""S.6-8.CV.2.MdC"", ""SS 6-8"", ""SS. 9-12"", ""SS.1 H.2"", ""SS.3-5 IS.7"", ""S.9-12.IS.12"", ""S.9-12.EC.FL.2""); grades follow table column rather than code where they differ (no conflicts found).
