HS.E.KE.1 Explain the impact of varying market structures on profit, price and production in Kentucky. HS.E.KE.2 Analyze how national and international trends and policies impact Kentucky’s state and local economies. HS.E.KE.3 Analyze how the four components of Gross Domestic Product (GDP) are combined to assess the health of Kentucky’s economy.
