k-12-louisiana-student-standards-for-social-studies_b9db19.pdf: u172-u178: 3-5 SP table uses a different layout (code in C1, text in C2) and is labeled 3-5.
k-12-louisiana-student-standards-for-social-studies_b9db19.pdf: Some units contain 'Ratifci ation', 'content-specifci', 'infulenced' typos from the source PDF; not corrected.
