5. “Letter from Abigail Adams to John Adams 31 March-5 April 1776” Adams Family Papers: An Electronic Archive. Massachusetts Historical Society. Correspondence during the period when Abigail managed the family farm in Braintree, Massachusetts and John served in the Continental Congress in Philadelphia; known for the line, “Remember the Ladies…” (see also http://www.masshist.org/digitaladams/)
