1) How does scarcity affect people? 2) How can people make good economic choices? 3) How do people use resources to produce goods and services? 4) Why do people trade? Standards connections: 2 – E1.0.2, 2 – E1.0.3, 2 – E1.0.4, 2 – E1.0.5
