8. Define relative price, market clearing/equilibrium price, shortage, and surplus. 9. Investigate the relationship between market clearing price and supply and demand. 10. Explain that market outcomes depend on available resources and government policies. 11. Relate shortages and surpluses to changes in price. 12. Discuss the concept of market price and exchange rates. 13. Examine how changes in supply or demand cause relative prices to change. 14. Relate government enforced price ceilings and floors to persistent shortages or surpluses.
Standard
Objectives
