with protecting individual rights and discuss how the basic premises of liberal
constitutionalism and democracy are joined in the Declaration of Independence as “self-
evident truths.”
10. Discuss how liberal constitutionalism and democracy are joined in the Declaration of
Independence as “self-evident truths.”
11. Trace Describe how the Founding Fathers’ realistic view of human nature led directly to
