Rev7_2023.11.30_Social_Studies_Content_Standards_2e5e84.pdf: u886: Sociology Domain 4 benchmark cell contains a mis-coded fourth benchmark 'SOC.6 12.4.4' (should be D4.4); left as is. u1262 and u1154 code typos noted. u836 (Era 3 benchmark 3) uses 'US 6-12.1-6.E3.3' code format.
