Nebraska-Social-Studies-Standards-Final-11-2019_bc9931.pdf: Pages 1 and 3 contain images only (cover; numbering-system figure after u30): no units. Page 6-7 etc. 'Standards numbering' key image not extracted. Some text truncated at cell edge (u190 'patriotic s', u200 'wa', u903 'thei', u873 'historica', u895 'governmenta').
