Nebraska-Social-Studies-Standards-Final-11-2019_bc9931.pdf: Recurring truncation of strand headings: some big-idea headings are separate units (u83-u84, u170-u172), some fused with the first standard (u36, u41, u49), and 'Not addressed at this level' placeholders (e.g. u56, u139, u334, u532-u533) are labeled standards because they carry SS codes.
