SS.5.12. Investigate what it meant to be an American for different groups of people in early American history. SS.5.13. Explore the development of colonial America and compare differences among the colonies. SS.5.14. Analyze the way in which Native, European, and African cultures were impacted by conflict and compromise in our nation’s early history.
