Civic and political
SS.6-8.EUSH.30. Examine the role the media has played in shaping public perception and policies throughout early U.S. history. SS.6-8.EUSH.31. Describe the different political, civil, religious, and economic organizations throughout U.S. history.
institutions (C)
Civic dispositions and
SS.6-8.EUSH.32. Analyze the expansion of representative government throughout early U.S. history. SS.6-8.EUSH.33. Compare a current national issue to a historical event from early U.S. history in order to propose a solution based upon past outcomes.
