SS.6-8.EUSH.37. Explain how changes in transportation, communication, and technology influenced the movement of people, goods, and ideas throughout early U.S. history. SS.6-8.EUSH.38. Explore the causes, motivations, and consequences of migration and immigration, both voluntary and forced, in early U.S. history, including but not limited to: Trail of Tears, western movement, Great Migration, various waves of immigration.
