Gathering and evaluating sources
SS.6-8.WGGS.4. Gather relevant information from multiple texts and evaluate the sourcing, context, and corroboration of the texts with close reading and discipline specific skills. SS.6-8.WGGS.5. Seek multiple media sources when investigating current issues and evaluate the credibility and reliability of each.
Developing claims and using evidence
SS.6-8.WGGS.6. Using varied source material, develop an argument based on substantive claims, with strong evidence and clear reasoning. SS.6-8.WGGS.7. Examine different arguments while pointing out the strengths and limitations of each.
Communicating and critiquing conclusions
