Exchange and markets
SS.6-8.WGGS.32. Explain how supply and demand, costs and competition influence market prices, wages, social, and environmental outcomes. SS.6-8.WGGS.33. Explain and evaluate how economic policies impact individuals, businesses, government structures, and international organizations.
