of formats and encompassing different points of view.",Final_2025_SS_OAS_fc721b.pdf,"Final_2025_SS_OAS_fc721b.pdf: Grade assignment: each grade/course section is a single table; grade comes from the section title cell and code prefix (PK.n, K.C/K.P, 1.C/1.P ... 8.C/8.P, course codes). The state guide's grouping of K as 0 and PK as separate matches the document.
