C. (K-1) Practice critical thinking skills by responding to various levels of open-ended questions.
D. (K-1) With guidance, demonstrate understanding of social studies content through completion of authentic tasks.
K-Grade 1
A. (K-1) Identify democratic principles such as equality, fairness, and respect for the law.
