RhodeIsland_SocialStudiesStandards_FULL_4c95f6.pdf: Learning Assessment Objectives (a, b, c ...) labeled standards (indicators that unpack the standard, per guide: indicators/benchmarks = standards); Guiding Questions for Instruction labeled examples. The LAOs contain many e.g. lists inside the same unit (not splittable).
