RhodeIsland_SocialStudiesStandards_FULL_4c95f6.pdf: Learning Assessment Objectives (a, b, c ...) labeled standards (indicators that unpack the standard, per guide: indicators/benchmarks = standards); Guiding Questions for Instruction labeled examples. The LAOs contain many e.g. lists inside the same unit (not splittable).
RhodeIsland_SocialStudiesStandards_FULL_4c95f6.pdf: Anchor-standard connection cells (CG.P ... E.EG) and X marks are interleaved with the standard title/statement text across many units and cannot be separated from them; they are labeled standards together with the standard statement (they are a cross-reference table, not content).
RhodeIsland_SocialStudiesStandards_FULL_4c95f6.pdf: State guide row clusters list HS courses as Civics, US History I/II, World History I/II; this part contains Civics, US History I, US History II, World History I (partial). Course strings used: 'Civics', 'United States History I: Pre-European Contact to Reconstruction', 'United States History II: Late 19th Century to the Present', 'World History I: Ancient to Medieval' (from the course headings).
