Learning Assessment Objectives: Students demonstrate an ability to: a. Explain the characteristics of a Golden Age (e.g., innovations in art, science, technology, a time of prosperity and achievements) b. Explain the inventions from the Han Dynasty (e.g., medicine, paper, compass), and argue their influence on the development of Chinese culture and their lasting impacts throughout history c. Argue the impact of trade on the expansion of empires, and development of a stable economy (e.g., Silk Road, Tea Horse Road) d. Identify the other dynasties (e.g., Qin, Jin, Sui, Tang) that contributed to the advancements and developments of civilization, and argue the impacts of those contributions
