Guiding Questions for Instruction: ● What contributed to the rise of the Roman Empire? ● What was the social structure of Roman empires, and who benefited from these structures? ● What role did government fulfill in the rise of the Roman Empire, and who could participate? ● How is early Roman government considered a democratic republic?
Guiding Questions for Instruction: ● How and why did the Roman Empire influence the spread of Judaism? ● What is the geographic and historical context of the development of Christianity? ● What are the major beliefs and practices of Christianity? ● How did Christian ideas spread?
