including the Greek Civil War, the Korean War, the Hungarian uprising, the Cuban Revolution, the Vietnam War, Cambodian genocide, the Prague Spring, and the Afghan-Soviet War. H E. The student explains the major events in the decolonization of Asia, Africa, Latin America, and
