Scarcity and Economic Reasoning Overview: Students will explore how limited resources restrict the goods and services that people may want and how consumers must choose some things and give up others. Students will consider systems and means created to meet and manage the issues of scarcity.
Explain how consumers and producers confront the condition of scarcity by making choices that involve opportunity costs and tradeoffs.
E
