Learning, Memory, and Intelligence Overview: Students will explore the process of learning as well as the process, types, disorders, and retrieval of memory. Students will also describe and discuss cognitive processes and intelligence along with their roles within human development.
Explain the process of learning, including principles of operant and classical conditioning as well as methods of observation.
