Age of Revolution (1750-1850) Overview: Students will analyze English efforts to limit the power of monarchs, the Age of Enlightenment, the American Revolution, and the French Revolution and discuss their enduring effects on political expectations for self-government and individual liberty.
Describe the types of kingdoms, leaders, and government systems in major world regions during the 18th century.
